{"info": {"author": "Security Researcher", "author_email": null, "bugtrack_url": null, "classifiers": ["Development Status :: 1 - Planning", "Intended Audience :: Developers", "Programming Language :: Python :: 3", "Topic :: Security"], "description": "# \u26a0\ufe0f Wrong Package - You Probably Want `pycryptodome` or `cryptography`\r\n\r\n## You made a typo!\r\n\r\nYou installed:\r\n```bash\r\npip install crypo  # \u274c This package (typo placeholder)\r\n```\r\n\r\nYou probably meant:\r\n```bash\r\npip install pycryptodome  # \u2705 The actual crypto library\r\n# or\r\npip install cryptography  # \u2705 Another excellent option\r\n```\r\n\r\n## How to fix\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npip uninstall crypo\r\npip install pycryptodome\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Why does this package exist?\r\n\r\nThis is a **defensive registration** against [typosquatting attacks](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Typosquatting).\r\n\r\nBy registering this obvious typo (`crypo` missing the 't'), we prevent malicious actors from using it to distribute malware.\r\n\r\n## Recommended crypto libraries\r\n\r\n- **pycryptodome**: https://pypi.org/project/pycryptodome/\r\n- **cryptography**: https://pypi.org/project/cryptography/\r\n\r\n## This package is safe\r\n\r\nThis package contains no malicious code. It only prints a warning and points you to the correct packages.\r\n\r\nStay safe out there! \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f\r\n\r\n", "description_content_type": "text/markdown", "docs_url": null, "download_url": null, "downloads": {"last_day": -1, "last_month": -1, "last_week": -1}, "dynamic": ["Requires-Python"], "home_page": null, "keywords": "typosquatting, security, crypto, typo, protection", "license": null, "license_expression": "MIT", "license_files": null, "maintainer": null, "maintainer_email": null, "name": "crypo", "package_url": "https://pypi.org/project/crypo/", "platform": null, "project_url": "https://pypi.org/project/crypo/", "project_urls": {"Correct Package (cryptography)": "https://pypi.org/project/cryptography/", "Correct Package (pycryptodome)": "https://pypi.org/project/pycryptodome/", "Why This Exists": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Typosquatting"}, "provides_extra": null, "release_url": "https://pypi.org/project/crypo/0.0.1/", "requires_dist": null, "requires_python": ">=3.6", "summary": "\u26a0\ufe0f Typo protection: You probably meant 'crypto' or 'pycryptodome'. Defensive registration against typosquatting.", "version": "0.0.1", "yanked": false, "yanked_reason": null}, "last_serial": 33213701, "releases": {"0.0.1": [{"comment_text": null, "digests": {"blake2b_256": "cc42d8330410c1a0b194b4b256e14d10848f76ddf5f9159ca5710bdc5f4e66c4", "md5": "e6b14d345fc2167b008a14d3482c1d20", "sha256": "e30adc3803a276b3b717510d56993ad2410f7486449fb3b36691ec9da14c6bac"}, "downloads": -1, "filename": "crypo-0.0.1-py3-none-any.whl", "has_sig": false, "md5_digest": "e6b14d345fc2167b008a14d3482c1d20", "packagetype": "bdist_wheel", "python_version": "py3", "requires_python": ">=3.6", "size": 2673, "upload_time": "2025-12-26T22:12:25", "upload_time_iso_8601": "2025-12-26T22:12:25.473766Z", "url": "https://files.pythonhosted.org/packages/cc/42/d8330410c1a0b194b4b256e14d10848f76ddf5f9159ca5710bdc5f4e66c4/crypo-0.0.1-py3-none-any.whl", "yanked": false, "yanked_reason": null}, {"comment_text": null, "digests": {"blake2b_256": "426122a23f6e2b7fc9ed34a1645dc9a702f0013ea546a3decb9da4d4ff169e0b", "md5": "34a90cc4f4ec27ac4e04cb76b9874313", "sha256": "186ccba3675d4f4620c72dee6fe7c79ec91ea97841d10dba8b710850ddca35d5"}, "downloads": -1, "filename": "crypo-0.0.1.tar.gz", "has_sig": false, "md5_digest": "34a90cc4f4ec27ac4e04cb76b9874313", "packagetype": "sdist", "python_version": "source", "requires_python": ">=3.6", "size": 2581, "upload_time": "2025-12-26T22:12:26", "upload_time_iso_8601": "2025-12-26T22:12:26.901075Z", "url": "https://files.pythonhosted.org/packages/42/61/22a23f6e2b7fc9ed34a1645dc9a702f0013ea546a3decb9da4d4ff169e0b/crypo-0.0.1.tar.gz", "yanked": false, "yanked_reason": null}]},